Inline image markers show where an image was inserted; match each marker ID to its image attachment block. Answer from attached vision input. Use attachment traits for original-file facts such as alpha, transparency, dimensions, color mode, and compositing. Attachment IDs are session-local markers, not artifact IDs; do not pass them to artifact tools unless a tool returns an artifact reference. For a local, downloaded or generated image, use read_file with its path; this attaches image content directly without opening a browser or desktop viewer. Animated images supply the first frame only; extract relevant frames when motion matters. If the active model cannot accept images, report that capability gap; a desktop viewer does not add model vision.
